# Environment variables for security.
# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in real values, or set these in
# your shell/CI environment directly. See SETUP.md for the full
# Keychain/1Password seeding options — env vars are only the first of four
# resolution sources tools/lib/resolve-credential.cjs tries.

# 1Password service-account token, scoped to the Automation vault, for headless/non-interactive `op` use (no desktop-app unlock prompt). Optional: an interactive shell with `op signin` already run works without it. Same convention as tools/lib/resolve-credential.cjs's own 1Password source.
OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN= (optional)
